> “We have a one-to-many relationship between the business and clients,
> a one-to-many relationship between clients and invoices,
> a one-to-many relationship between invoices and payments,
> and a many-to-many relationship between invoices and items.
> The join table `wp_ays_invoice_items` handles that many-to-many bridge.”

