## 🧱 About Using WPDB

Yep, we’ll use `$wpdb` directly — no need for a full ORM.
It’s efficient and integrates with your autoload classes cleanly.

Example pattern for joining with the new bridge:

```php
$results = $wpdb->get_results("
  SELECT i.*, s.name AS service_name
  FROM {$wpdb->prefix}ays_invoices AS i
  JOIN {$wpdb->prefix}ays_invoice_services AS isr ON i.id = isr.invoice_id
  JOIN {$wpdb->prefix}ays_service_types AS s ON isr.service_type_id = s.id
  WHERE i.client_id = {$client_id}
");
```

That’s pure `$wpdb` — lightweight and secure.

